comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-29T02:12:25.679Z",codex-agent,"JSON shape capture now uses a separately bounded canonical media type even when the displayed header selection omits Content-Type; application/problem+json and the public GitHub JSON type are admitted. A header-cap fixture proves missing media evidence is reported as incomplete. Focused ceiling, timeout-after-write and shape tests passed 3/3."
  "2026-10-29T05:42:49.533Z",codex-agent,"PR 1 re-review: separate safe media-type display from bounded JSON-family detection so arbitrary valid application/*+json media types retain structure while their raw subtype and parameters stay redacted. Audit headers, transport, comparisons and both renderers, with generated MIME fixtures and packed consumers."
  "2026-10-29T06:36:11.148Z",codex-agent,"General rule: redaction must preserve safe structural semantics. Audited transport, SDK, CLI, compare and both renderers: JSON classification now recognizes every valid application/*+json token independently of the displayed media allowlist. Twelve real fixture captures plus 128 generated subtype classifications retain matching structure without persisting opaque subtype/parameter text. The media-family revert fails and restoration passes; packed consumers exercise application/vnd.api+json with a matching shape contract."
